\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0   O Lord, Thou who art in heaven,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Thou caused us to be born in homes
\par Thou hast giv'n children good parents,
\par And very helpful keepers too
\par \i  Refrain:\i0   Oh Father, pour Thy blessings
\par which comes from heaven upon our homes.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  Forgive our sins within our homes,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 And redeem us from all our pride,
\par So that parents and their children
\par Always humble themselves for Thee.
\par \i Refrain:\i0   Oh Father, pour Thy blessings.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  Oh Christ, our children and adults;
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Master, let them be united,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 Both in joy and in their suffering;
\par Both in leisure and when at work
\par \i  \b Refrain:\b0\i0   Oh Father, pour thy blessing.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.Oh Father, do control our homes
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 And direct our activities.
\par Both in joyand in our suffering,
\par And always be our daily guide.
\par \b\i Refrain:\b0\i0  Oh Father, pour Thy blessings.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

